# fzf flags for hosting in the column (NULL.md §7.4).
#
# Every one of these replaces a DEFAULT that is a banned glyph (I1), and each
# was found by running fzf and reading the codepoints -- never by reading its
# configuration.
#
# The gutter is the one that hides longest: it is the empty column beside every
# line that is NOT current, so it draws on every visible row at once. A comment
# listing the pointer, marker and scrollbar is exactly the comment that omits it.
--pointer=>
--marker=*
--scrollbar=│
--gutter=' '
--no-unicode
--border=none
--info=inline
